#: behaviour.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Behavior</h1> You can configure how Konqueror behaves as a "
"file manager here."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:51
msgid "Misc Options"
msgstr "Misc ఐచ్చికాలు"

#: behaviour.cpp:60
msgid "Open folders in separate &windows"
msgstr "(&w) ఫోల్డర్లను ప్రత్యే విండోలనందు తెరువుము"

#: behaviour.cpp:61
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, Konqueror will open a new window when you open a "
"folder, rather than showing that folder's contents in the current window."
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:85
msgctxt "@title:group what to do when a file is deleted"
msgid "Ask Confirmation For"
msgstr "దీనికొరకు నిర్ధారణను అడుగుము"

#: behaviour.cpp:86
msgid ""
"This option tells Konqueror whether to ask for a confirmation when you "
"\"delete\" a file. <ul><li><em>Move To Trash:</em> moves the file to your "
"trash folder, from where it can be recovered very easily.</li> "
"<li><em>Delete:</em> simply deletes the file.</li> </ul>"
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:93
msgctxt "@option:check Ask for confirmation when moving to trash"
msgid "&Move to trash"
msgstr "(&M) ట్రాష్‌కు కదుపుము"

#: behaviour.cpp:96
msgctxt "@option:check Ask for confirmation when deleting"
msgid "D&elete"
msgstr "(&e) తొలగించు"

#: behaviour.cpp:106
msgid "Show 'Delete' context me&nu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr ""

#: behaviour.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Check this if you want 'Delete' menu commands to be displayed on the desktop "
"and in the file manager's context menus. You can always delete files by "
"holding the Shift key while calling 'Move to Trash'."
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:95
msgid ""
"<h1>Paths</h1>\n"
"This module allows you to choose where in the filesystem the files on your "
"desktop should be stored.\n"
"Use the \"Whats This?\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options."
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:102
msgid "Des&ktop path:"
msgstr "(&k) రంగస్థలం దారి:"

#: globalpaths.cpp:110
msgid ""
"This folder contains all the files which you see on your desktop. You can "
"change the location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will "
"move automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:118
msgid "A&utostart path:"
msgstr "(&u) స్వయంచాలకప్రారంభం దారి:"

#: globalpaths.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This folder contains applications or links to applications (shortcuts) that "
"you want to have started automatically whenever KDE starts. You can change "
"the location of this folder if you want to, and the contents will move "
"automatically to the new location as well."
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:135
msgid "D&ocuments path:"
msgstr "(&o) పత్రముల దారి:"

#: globalpaths.cpp:143
msgid "This folder will be used by default to load or save documents from or to."
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:271 globalpaths.cpp:288
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "స్వయంచాలకప్రారంభం"

#: globalpaths.cpp:275
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "రంగస్ఠలం"

#: globalpaths.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The path for '%1' has been changed.\n"
"Do you want the files to be moved from '%2' to '%3'?"
msgstr ""

#: globalpaths.cpp:352
msgid "Confirmation Required"
msgstr "నిర్ధారణ అవసరమైంది"

#: globalpaths.cpp:352
msgctxt "Move desktop files from old to new place"
msgid "Move"
msgstr "కదుపు"

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:96
msgid "Menu Editor"
msgstr "పట్టి ఎడిటర్"

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:103
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "మెనూ"

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:107
msgid "New..."
msgstr "కొత్త..."

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:108
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "తొలగించు"

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:109
msgid "Move Up"
msgstr "పైకి కదుపు"

#: kcustommenueditor.cpp:110
msgid "Move Down"
msgstr "క్రిందికి కదుపు"

